# Weekly jobs for the telemetry receiver.
#
# Salt rotation no longer needs cron. Since 2026-10-02 the receiver keeps the salt for the current
# ISO week in $SALT_FILE (the telemetry_salt volume, format "<YYYY-WW> <64 hex>", mode 0600), so a
# restart mid-week keeps it. The first ping of a new week replaces it with a fresh random salt
# (receiver/persisted-salt.js). Last week's salt is overwritten, so hashes from different weeks
# cannot be linked.
#
# Still needed weekly (installed since 2026-10-02): roll completed weeks into pings_weekly, then delete
# the per-row rows of every ISO week that ended more than 90 days ago (receiver/finalise-week.sh).
# Entry for the operator's crontab (Monday 00:05 UTC), with <checkout> the path of this repository:
#
#   5 0 * * 1 FINALISE_LOG=$HOME/.local/state/telemetry-finalise.log /usr/bin/flock -n /tmp/telemetry-finalise.lock <checkout>/receiver/finalise-week.sh >/dev/null 2>>$HOME/.local/state/telemetry-finalise.err.log
